The implementation was rebuilt for Attune and NetBox 4.6.8. The shared direct
REST client, curated resource map, action contracts, pagination, Attune Key
credential handling, TLS controls, ETag concurrency, allocation behavior,
confirmations, and tests are new. The approximately 632 generated upstream
action definitions and the Flask webhook sensor were not retained.

